        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Paris</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 250 BCE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Founded</span><span class="info-stat-val">Settled by the Gallic Parisii between 250 and 225 BCE, with traces of earlier occupation from about 8000 BCE; the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/roman-empire">Romans</a> built the town of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lutetia">Lutetia</a> after their conquest of 52 BCE</span></div>
